- op: discuss  # e8c4
  at: '2026-10-02T03:21:04Z'  # e8c4
  by: agent  # e8c4
  actor: jgstern_agent  # e8c4
  clock: 6  # e8c4
  nonce: e8c4  # e8c4
  message: "DONE: merged in PR #1381 (commit 4da2903ed2; integration kept WI-komum's _detect_language and its import alongside the new _name_args import). New shared linkers/_name_args.py (ConstantResolver, name_arg, pair_by_name) used by the message-queue, IPC and event-sourcing linkers: an identifier bound to a same-file module-level string constant resolves to its value; otherwise value None + *_identifier meta; joins on value, on identifier only when one side's value is unknown; an identifier's text is never compared with a string. Behavioural evidence (live, before/after): the filed MQ fixture went from no edge (topic=EVENTS_TOPIC) to topic=orders + topic_identifier=EVENTS_TOPIC + a topic_match 0.9 edge (pinned by test_item_repro_variable_publish_reaches_literal_subscriber); IPC const channel: no edge -> 0.85; event-sourcing const: wrong case-folded join at 0.65 -> correct join at 0.85. Corpus (23 repos): 0 edges added/removed, 389 relabelled, 21 constants resolved (all correct). NOT asserted: that no linker stores an identifier as a value (websocket/http: WI-luhod P2; imported/attribute/local constants: WI-fuduz P3). Report: run_09302026/misod.md"  # e8c4
